    "premise": "The covenant kept services alive, but the correction hearing needs one city map rather than three departmental strips. West, centre, and east surveys overlap by a full column. Their drawings are locally plausible only if the four shaft mouths form the exact boundary between the connected surface feeder and underground ring.",
