    "diagnostics": "The checker rejects square-only canonicalization, uncovered seams, decorative level labels, disconnected layers, false portals, and a strip placed in a reflected orientation.",
    "hints": [
      "Place the three two-column strips left to right.",
      "Count repeated edges at both overlaps.",
      "The middle row belongs to the underground graph but is incident to the surface shafts."
